\ No newline at end of file
+> docker run -v "$(pwd):/code" -w /code sokrates init
+
+### Landscape
+
+Create or refresh a landscape report, aggregating the analyses found under an analysis root:
+> java -jar sokrates.jar analyzeLandscape -analysisRoot <folder>
+
+The report is created in `<folder>/_sokrates_landscape` (`index.html`). `analyzeLandscape` is the landscape counterpart of the analysis commands; `updateLandscape` is the same command under its older name. Use `-help` to see the usage of either command.
